    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "FASTEN SEAT BELT\nRELEASE SEAT BELT\nNORTHWEST\nFor your safety we recommend you keep your seat belt fastened while you are seated.\nTAKE OFF \u0026 LANDING\nDC-9\nSERIES 30\nOVERWATER\nSAFETY\nFEATURES\nDo Not Remove\nFrom Aircraft\nBRACE POSITIONS",
      "OXYGEN MASK\nDOOR\nEXIT\nEVACUATION\nSLIDE\nQuickly pull mask to activate oxygen flow. The bag will not fully inflate.\nTighten mask for a secure fit.\nWINDOW EXIT\nTAILCONE EXIT: PLUG HATCH TYPE\nEXIT\nEXIT\nLAND EVACUATION\nLocated at the rear of the aircraft is either a plug hatch type or a pressure bulkhead door.\nTAILCONE EXIT: PRESSURE BULKHEAD DOOR\nLocated in tailcone area.",
      "LIFE VEST\nNORTHWEST\nLIFE RAFT\nEMERGENCY\nPATH\nLIGHTS\nWATER EVACUATION\n352\n→ 3.\nRed lights are\ngrouped at\nEmergency Exits\n00-0410-3-3072"
    ],
